{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Alley Cats Idle</strong>\u2014a laid-back game all about building your very own bustling alley full of charming cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a curious stray or two, then sit back as your alley fills with a colorful cast of feline personalities. Each cat you collect brings its own style and antics to your growing urban hideaway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect Cats</strong> \u2013 Unlock a wide variety of cats, from scrappy alley prowlers to fluffy cuddlebugs, each with unique looks and personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964200/extras/876f23f8010fb486a51e00ea7e850024.poster.avif?t=1765295479\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964200/extras/876f23f8010fb486a51e00ea7e850024.webm?t=1765295479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964200/extras/876f23f8010fb486a51e00ea7e850024.mp4?t=1765295479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a <strong>Idle &amp; Relax</strong> \u2013 Earn coins even while you\u2019re afk \u2014 your cats never stop exploring, playing, and napping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming Style</strong> \u2013 Relax with cozy visuals and a lighthearted atmosphere perfect for cat lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player who enjoys checking in from time to time or someone who loves unlocking every collectible, <i>Alley Cats Idle</i> is a relaxing, feel-good experience about friendship, discovery, and of course\u2026 cats.</p>","background":"h